// The program's icon, embedded in PokeDaisy.exe: Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab take it from here (the host also sets
// it on the window, linux/main.c's set_window_icon). The picture is the app's own launcher icon:
// app/src/main/res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher_background.png under _foreground.png, written at 16 to 256 pixels into
// pokedaisy.ico beside this file.
1 ICON "pokedaisy.ico"

// The manifest (CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID 1, RT_MANIFEST 24): per-monitor DPI awareness, see the file.
1 24 "pokedaisy.manifest"
